Foresight leaderboard: renewal risk

Split      validation: contracts ending 2024-07-01 to 2024-12-31
           6 monthly cohorts, 2,083 contracts, 122 leavers
           240 calls: the top 40 of each cohort
Method     every model by foresight.evaluate's backtest,
           fitted on the outcomes known at each cohort's mark
Intervals  95%, 2,000 bootstrap resamples, the same for every list

           leavers  precision at 40   AUC
logistic        57  23.8 (18.3-29.6)  0.801 (0.761-0.840)
lasso           60  25.0 (19.2-30.4)  0.815 (0.776-0.854)
forest          58  24.2 (18.8-29.6)  0.792 (0.748-0.833)
boosting        56  23.3 (17.9-29.2)  0.812 (0.773-0.849)
rule            53  22.1 (16.7-28.3)  0.762 (0.714-0.808)
random          14  5.9               0.500
perfect        122  50.8              1.000

